 Point-to-Point Summary

* 12V Line: Battery (+) $\rightarrow$ Buck `IN+` & 7-in-1 `Brown (VCC)`
* 5V Line: Buck `OUT+` $\rightarrow$ ESP32 `VIN` & RS-485 `VCC`
* 3.3V Line: ESP32 `3V3` $\rightarrow$ Capacitive Sensor `VCC`, DS18B20 `Red`, and one leg of the `4.7 kΩ` resistor
* Common GND: Battery (-), Buck `IN-`, Buck `OUT-`, ESP32 `GND`, RS-485 `GND`, 7-in-1 `Black`, DS18B20 `Black`, Capacitive `GND`
* **Signals:**
* Capacitive `AOUT` $\rightarrow$ ESP32 `GPIO 34`
* DS18B20 `Yellow/White` $\rightarrow$ ESP32 `GPIO 15` (+ other leg of `4.7 kΩ` resistor)
* RS-485 `RO` $\rightarrow$ ESP32 `GPIO 16`
* RS-485 `DI` $\rightarrow$ ESP32 `GPIO 17`
* RS-485 `DE` & `RE` (shorted together) $\rightarrow$ ESP32 `GPIO 4`
* RS-485 `A` $\rightarrow$ 7-in-1 `Yellow (A)`
* RS-485 `B` $\rightarrow$ 7-in-1 `Blue (B)`
